# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# Rust
/target/
**/target/
Cargo.lock.bak

# C# / .NET
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
*.user
*.suo
*.userprefs
.vs/
.idea/
*.csproj.user

# Godot
.godot/
/client/export/
export_presets.cfg
!client/src/DungeonBarrage.Client/export_presets.cfg

# Build output
/dist/
/out/
/export/
/.agents/

# Credentials — NEVER commit. See docs/SECURITY_BASELINE.md section 4.
.github-token
*.token
*github_pat_*
.env
.env.*
*.pem

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs
*.log
.devserver*.log

# Optional WASM output (dormant, see ADR 0004)
/crates/db-sim-wasm/pkg/

# .NET client build output
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
*.user

# Native simulation libraries staged for local runs.
#
# These are `cargo build --release -p db-sim-ffi` output, not source. Committing them would put a
# 600 KB binary in history on every rebuild and — worse — let the repository disagree with the
# crate it was built from. `client/native/README.md` documents how to repopulate them.
/client/native/*/*.dll
/client/native/*/*.so
/client/native/*/*.dylib
/client/native/*/*.pdb
